title: <span style="color: [+ rb_colour +];">**[+ reichsbanner_name +]**</span> overfounding 
subtitle: The party does not approve of the sums we've spent on pur paramilitary.
on-arrival: rb_founding_cealing += 1; left_dissent += 3; center_dissnet += 3; labor_dissent += 3; reformist_dissent += 5
tags: event
view-if: rb_founding_cealing < 0
priority: 1
max-visits: 1


= <span style="color: [+ rb_colour +];">**[+ reichsbanner_name +]**</span> overfounding 


Many in the party see our founding of the <span style="color: [+ rb_colour +];">**[+ reichsbanner_name +]**</span> as a burden that deprives the other party organs of their resources.


- @pull_out: Cut founding for the <span style="color: [+ rb_colour +];">**[+ reichsbanner_name +]**</span> 
- @bribe_spd: Give handouts to dissenters
- @ignore_l: Oh, you think this is too much spending, huh? Well, guess what, we will put even more Reichsmarks into the <span style="color: [+ rb_colour +];">**[+ reichsbanner_name +]**</span> until we have the strongest army not just in Germany but in all of Europe and there. is. nothing. you can do. about it.


@pull_out
subtitle: +1 resources
on-arrival: resources += 1; rb_militancy -= 0.05; rb_strength -= 100; reformist_dissent -= 2; labor_dissent -= 2

The money has returned.
  
@bribe_spd
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; left_dissent -= 2; center_dissent -= 3; labor_dissnet -= 4; reformist_dissent -= 6
choose-if: resources >= 1

We have given resources to the party branches voicing most opposition. Obviously they will use that for sensible goals.


